                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Mugume mukore eby'oburyo n'eby'okuhikiirira, abanyagirwe mubaihe omu mikono y'abarikubahata, kandi omunyaihanga n'efuuzi n'omufaakazi mutabakora kubi, n'obu kwakuba okubakorera eby'obubisha, nari okusheesha eshagama y'abataine rubanja omuri ogu mwanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.17.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 17:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba ku muraayorobere ekigambo eki omu mzaima, abagabe abari aha ngoma ya Daudi baryaguma nibataahira omu marembo g'ebikaari by'egi nju, bari omu bigaari by'orugamba n'aha mbaraasi, bo n'abaragwa baabo, n'abantu baabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
